omx-panel (0.7.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * omx-panel layout --pages --per-page N cuts each section into pages of at
    most N controls, in the section's order, keeping a declared group that fits
    a page whole and naming each page of a section by the controls it holds
    ("Band: Freq - Type"); without --per-page the pages are the plain cut of
    eight, as before. A four-encoder device gets pages of four (#93).

