omx-panel (0.4.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * omx-modgui-sync reads the LV2 search list as plugin-hostd and plugin-qualify
    do ($LV2_PATH, else plugin-hostd's default), writes its bundles to
    /usr/local/lib/lv2 (~/.lv2 for a user; the folder may hold plugins too, and
    the bundles are named omx-modgui-<name>.lv2), and has --check: it says
    whether mod-host and mod-ui read the folder, and lists the CLAP search
    list (#44).
